            <ArticleTitle>Improving evidence based cardiac care and policy implementation over the patient journey: the potential of coronary heart disease registers.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1127-30</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Coronary heart disease registers offer considerable potential for providing increased support for practitioners, facilitating improvements in patient care, and allowing efficient monitoring of care provision and outcomes.</AbstractText>
